stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Seed

  Seed: Seed mode — no GHOST_URL (v1)
  Live: Live mode — Content API reachable
  Snapshot: Snapshot fallback — last committed snapshot
  ColdStart: Cold start — build throws

  Seed --> Live: set GHOST_URL + GHOST_CONTENT_API_KEY
  Live --> Snapshot: fetch fails
  Snapshot --> Live: API reachable again
  Live --> ColdStart: fetch fails and no snapshot
  ColdStart --> Snapshot: run snapshot-ghost.ts, rebuild
  ColdStart --> Live: fix credentials
  ColdStart --> Seed: unset Ghost env vars
  Live --> Seed: delete env vars (revert)
